"You're using it now. Auto-switch moves you off it at %@ and won't move you back to it." = "您正在使用它。自动切换会在 %@ 时离开它，且不会再切换回来。";
"Every account except the one you're using is Manual only, so auto-switch has nowhere to move you." = "除您正在使用的账户外，其他账户均为“仅手动”，因此自动切换无处可切。";
"Drag an account to change the order. \"My order\" in Settings → General tries accounts from the top down, and every account list follows this order. A threshold other than the default applies to that account only. Manual only accounts are never switched to automatically; you can still switch to them yourself." = "拖动账户即可调整顺序。设置 → 通用中的“我的顺序”会从上到下依次尝试账户，所有账户列表也都按此顺序显示。非默认的阈值只对该账户生效。自动切换永远不会切换到“仅手动”账户；您仍可自行切换到它们。";
"Auto-switch never moves you to this account. You can still switch to it here." = "自动切换永远不会切换到此账户。您仍可在此切换到它。";
"Any account can have its own threshold in Settings → Accounts, from 1% to 100%, or be Manual only so auto-switch never moves you to it. 100% uses an account until it is empty." = "每个账户都可以在设置 → 账户中设置 1% 到 100% 的阈值，或设为“仅手动”，让自动切换永远不会切换到它。设为 100% 表示用完为止。";
"When the active account's 5-hour, weekly or Fable usage reaches its threshold, PixelSwitch switches to another account that is at least 10 points under its own threshold (at or under half of it, for thresholds below 20%) and is not Manual only. Turn off the Fable switch above to leave Fable as a reading only, while the 5-hour and weekly limits keep switching. Checked on every refresh; a 5-minute cooldown prevents rapid flip-flopping." = "当活跃账户的 5 小时、每周或 Fable 用量达到其阈值时，PixelSwitch 会切换到另一个比其自身阈值至少低 10 个百分点（阈值低于 20% 时为不超过其一半）且不是“仅手动”的账户。关闭上方的 Fable 开关后，Fable 仅作为显示，5 小时与每周限额仍会触发切换。每次刷新时检查；5 分钟冷却时间可防止频繁来回切换。";
"Auto-switch moves you off this account at %@, and moves you to it only while it is at %@ or less (%@ or less when it switches early before this account's weekly quota resets)." = "自动切换会在 %@ 时离开此账户，且仅在其用量不超过 %@ 时切换到它（在此账户的每周额度重置前提前切换时，不超过 %@）。";
